
TITLE                                                                 OLDFLAIR
GLOBAL         5000.                                                  OLDFLAIR
* Set the defaults for precision simulations
DEFAULTS                                                              PRECISIO

BEAM       -0.198400                                                  PROTON
* Needed for source routine.
* User must compile source file.
SOURCE
* Physics cards that allows Coalescense and Evaporation (for PGs)
PHYSICS          3.0                                                  EVAPORAT
PHYSICS          1.0                                                  COALESCE
* NOVCoDA rotation cards. Adjust azimuthal angles for rotations
ROT-DEFI        300.       0.0      90.0       -7.       -7.     -10.5NOVO_rot
ROT-DEFI        100.       0.0      90.0       0.0       0.0       0.0NOVO_rot
ROT-DEFI        300.       0.0      180.       0.0       0.0       0.0NOVO_rot
GEOBEGIN                                                              COMBNAME
* Black body
SPH blkbody    0.0 0.0 0.0 100000.0
* Void sphere
SPH void       0.0 0.0 0.0 10000.0
* NOVCoDA geometrical shapes
$start_transform NOVO_rot
$start_translat 0.0 0.0 36.7
* Intersection planes
YZP odd_pos    14.0
YZP odd_neg    0.0
XZP even_pos   14.0
XZP even_neg   0.0
YZP odd_Hpos   14.2
YZP odd_Hneg   -0.2
XZP evn_Hpos   14.2
XZP evn_Hneg   -0.2
* Voidboxes for void definition
RPP voidbox1   0.0 14.0 0.0 14.0 0.0 21.0
RPP voidbox2   -12.0 0.0 0.0 14.05 -0.3 22.2
RPP voidbox3   14.0 26.0 0.0 14.05 -0.3 22.2
RPP voidbox4   0.0 14.05 -12.0 0.0 -0.3 22.2
RPP voidbox5   0.0 14.05 14.0 26.0 -0.3 22.2
